        "image_animation": "none",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/kerlora-about-us-kerlora-community.jpg",
        "link": "",
        "link_2": "",
        "second_image_offset_top": 10,
        "title": "Welcome to the Kerlora community. ",
        "sub_title": "",
        "text": "<p>Kerlora was built from a real life connection to the power of movement. Exercise has the ability to go beyond the physical, supporting with emotional and mental clarity during the ups and downs of life. <br/><br/>With real women and real bodies in mind, Kerlora exists to remove the pressure of perfection often seen within the fitness industry. Every design is built with you in mind, giving you comfort and confidence however you move your body. <br/><br/>We offer high quality, effortless athleisure that fits into your lifestyle and your wardrobe. Taking you from the school drop off, to your weekly fitness class, run in the park or coffee date, each piece has been intentionally designed and curated into a wearable collection.   <br/><br/>At Kerlora we believe that movement goes beyond the aesthetic, allowing you to breathe easier, think clearer and connect back to what is most important. </p>",
        "text_size": "medium",
        "content_alignment": "left",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "m-button--link",
        "button_size": "",
        "padding_top": 40,
        "padding_bottom": 40,
        "custom_class": "",
        "animations": "inherit"
      }
    },
    "image_with_text_UJGXY7": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "name": "Image with text",
      "settings": {
        "heading": "",
        "heading_size": "h3",
        "subheading": "",
        "container": "container-fluid",
        "color_scheme": "",
        "item_gap": 100,
        "item_gap_mobile": 30,
        "layout": "right",
        "image_column_size": "6",
        "image_overlap": false,
        "show_image_reverse": false,
        "hover_effect": false,
        "image_animation": "none",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/kerlora-about-us-kerstys-words.png",
        "link": "",
        "link_2": "",
        "second_image_offset_top": 10,
        "title": "In Kersty’s words...",
        "sub_title": "",
        "text": "<p>‘For the longest time I struggled with worrying about mine and my familys health which I began to notice was giving me high levels of anxiety. I turned to movement in the hopes of finding a sense of comfort and release from the mental fog. As I moved I began to find an escape and safe sanctuary from the irrational thoughts and overthinking which were clouding my life. <br/><br/>As a mum to three amazing children I’ve realised that consistency in anything is key. Showing up for yourself on the good days and the bad days is where the real change and growth lies. And so movement became the real constant in my life to help me manage my health anxiety. <br/><br/>But when I looked for athleisure pieces to support me through this journey, I constantly  found myself looking at brands and questioning my body. How could I possibly fit into the aesthetic that they were portraying? Exercise for me wasn’t about being perfect but about finding greater physical and mental strength. And so, not seeing myself reflected in any of the brands on the market, I decided to build my own. <br/><br/>I’m not a body builder, pro athlete or fitness guru but I know the demands we face as women and how moving our bodies, being in a space of community and really being seen can make everything else feel less important. <br/><br/>Kerlora exists for you, this beautiful community that has grown from my own lived and learnt experiences. I’m so excited for you to join me on the journey.’<br/></p>",
        "text_size": "medium",
        "content_alignment": "left",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "m-button--link",
        "button_size": "",
        "padding_top": 40,
        "padding_bottom": 40,
        "custom_class": "",
        "animations": "inherit"
      }
    },
