        "image": "shopify://shop_images/kerlora-about-us-our-mission.jpg",
        "link": "",
        "link_2": "",
        "second_image_offset_top": 10,
        "title": "Our Mission & Values",
        "sub_title": "",
        "text": "<p>At Kerlora we are committed to giving our community the freedom to find strength in movement. From physical to mental strength and clarity we exist to give you the power back. <br/><br/>With this comes the opportunity to seek inner courage as you find safety and security in movement, however it looks for you. <br/><br/>Family and community is at the heart of everything we do. Feeling connected, sharing the growth, and finding a sense of belonging is what we advocate for in our spaces. <br/><br/>And with all of this comes the need for consistency and balance. We encourage a considered and steady approach to life to ensure you look after yourself, find joy in the small things and stay strong both physically and mentally. <br/><br/>This is Kerlora. </p>",
        "text_size": "medium",
        "content_alignment": "left",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "m-button--link",
        "button_size": "",
        "padding_top": 80,
        "padding_bottom": 80,
        "custom_class": "",
        "animations": "inherit"
      }
    },
